WEBVTT

00:34:58.958 --> 00:35:01.809
EP: No, but look, helping
is a lot of things, right?

00:35:01.833 --> 00:35:04.934
Helping makes you feel rich,

00:35:04.958 --> 00:35:06.268
I mean, rich internally.

00:35:06.292 --> 00:35:09.309
Helping is the most
powerful antidepressant,

00:35:09.333 --> 00:35:10.601
doing for others.

00:35:10.625 --> 00:35:11.893
AG: Yeah.

00:35:11.917 --> 00:35:14.809
EP: Helping, you know,
generosity brings joy.

00:35:14.833 --> 00:35:18.768
Helping is indeed -- other people need me,
I will never be alone.

00:35:18.792 --> 00:35:21.101
They come to me, I'm protected.

00:35:21.125 --> 00:35:22.434
Helping is a state

00:35:22.458 --> 00:35:24.684
in which I don't have to
be dependent on others

00:35:24.708 --> 00:35:26.726
because I make others be dependent on me.

00:35:26.750 --> 00:35:29.893
Helping has a lot of aspects to it.
Which one it is for you?

00:35:29.917 --> 00:35:31.851
See, this is where it becomes different.